{
  "description": "Golden digest vectors for amq.remote.command/1. Each vector is a complete command and its expected input_digest (sha256 hex with sha256: prefix). A Go test asserts CommandDigest reproduces each; a foreign carrier runs the same vectors to prove it agrees.",
  "vectors": [
